                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The machine produced three",
                    "Master Balls before it",
                    "seized. Three. You promised",
                    "hundreds."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 6,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The numbers you quoted were",
                    "considerably higher. Were",
                    "you lying to me about its",
                    "capabilities?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The ball was never designed",
                    "for mass production. I told",
                    "you this, Giovanni. It needs",
                    "more time."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Time is a luxury you no",
                    "longer have. This was not",
                    "the arrangement."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 21,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Do I need to remind you",
                    "what happens to those who",
                    "fail to deliver?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 24,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Please — you have to give",
                    "it more time. That's all I",
                    "ask..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Very well. But know this:",
                    "three Master Balls will",
                    "suffice for now. The League",
                    "won't know what hit them."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
